<nt = 'http://www.jcp.org/jcr/nt/1.0'>
<mix = 'http://www.jcp.org/jcr/mix/1.0'>
<jnt = 'http://www.jahia.org/jahia/nt/1.0'>
<fmdbmix = 'http://www.jahia.org/jahia/fmdb/mix/1.0'>
<fmdbsfdc = 'http://www.jahia.org/jahia/fmdbsfdc/nt/1.0'>

// Creates (or upserts) a Salesforce Lead from the submitted form values.
// The Salesforce connection (instance URL, consumer key, private key) lives in operator
// configuration (org.jahia.modules.formidable.salesforce-<id>.cfg); JCR only holds its id.
// fieldMapping is a JSON document authored by the SalesforceLeadMapping selector type.
[fmdbsfdc:createLeadAction] > jnt:content, fmdbmix:formAction, fmdbmix:readOnlyCompatibleAction, mix:title
 - jcr:title (string) = resourceBundle('fmdbsfdc_createLeadAction') autocreated i18n
 - connectionId (string, choicelist[formidableSfdcConnections]) mandatory indexed=no
 - fieldMapping (string) indexed=no
 - duplicateStrategy (string, choicelist[resourceBundle]) = 'create' autocreated indexed=no < 'create', 'upsertByEmail'
 - failSubmissionOnError (boolean) = true autocreated indexed=no
